00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
God, as a direct consequence of the sin which man thus punished, had given her a lovely child,

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
whose place was on that same dishonored bosom to connect her parent forever with the race and descent of mortals,

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
and to be finally a blessed soul in heaven.
